    <item>
      <title>Version 1.1.4</title>
      <sparkle:os>macos</sparkle:os>
      <pubDate>Mon, 11 May 2026 15:48:00 +0800</pubDate>
      <sparkle:version>6</sparkle:version>
      <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.1.4</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>12.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <description><![CDATA[
        <h2>v1.1.4 — Nested Entry Folders</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>Entry sidebar now renders the full nested folder tree — previously only the top-level subfolder showed, and deeper PDFs were lumped under it</li>
          <li>Each subfolder has its own expand/collapse chevron and remembers state across rebuilds</li>
          <li>Counts on each node now reflect all PDFs in that subtree</li>
          <li>Subfolder filter no longer matches sibling folders by accident (e.g. "Avatar" no longer matches "AvatarStudio/…")</li>
        </ul>
      ]]></description>
